# Bot1 has Rest in Peace out on turn 1. On turn 3 Faithless Looting makes Bot1 discard Basking Rootwalla and a Mountain.
# Madness (CR 702.35a) and Rest in Peace both replace the Rootwalla's trip to the graveyard, and Bot1, its owner, orders
# them (CR 616.1). Bot1 applies Rest in Peace first: the card is exiled and no longer going to a graveyard, so madness no
# longer applies (CR 616.1f) and its "when this card is exiled this way" never triggers - the stack is empty at the next
# priority. The Mountain meets only Rest in Peace and is not asked about. The Island is Bot2's turn-2 discard to hand size.

